  },
  "**[Setzer] Anyway find and talk with Gran Kiltias. Hope he acknowledge her as the rightful heir to the throne of Dalmasca!**": {
    "translation": "尽力找到基里迪亚斯,希望他能让她以合法继承人的身份前往王座"
  },
  "**[Setzer] Dark clouds begin to gather over Temple Grounds. This is a bad sign**": {
    "translation": "神殿情形不对,要坏事了"
  },
  "**[Bash] We do not know they set additional traps for us! Be vigilant! Hold here for 20 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "我们不知道他们设下了陷阱,在这里坚持20秒"
  },
  "**[Bash] The gates are open. We have finally entered the temple**": {
    "translation": "门打开了,我们终于进来了"
  },
  "**[Bash] Find the way to the Hall of The Light and talk with Gran Kiltias**": {
    "translation": "想办法前往大厅与基里迪亚斯交谈"
  },
  "**The Gates of Temple will open in 35 seconds!**": {
    "translation": "神殿大门35秒后打开"
  },
  "**[Ruprecht] Hello buddy I'm santa's helper. Could you do me a little favor for this fat ass?": {
    "translation": "[鲁普雷希特] 你好伙计,我是圣诞老人的助手,能帮那个胖家伙一个小忙吗?"
  },
  "**[Ruprecht] I need to collect letters from all mailboxes in the Mt Bur-Omisace**": {
    "translation": "我需要收集奥米尔赛斯所有邮筒里的信件"
  },
  "**[Ruprecht] If you can help me with them I will be very grateful!**": {
    "translation": "如果你能帮我收集它们,我会非常感激!"
  },
  "**[Ruprecht] All you have to do is go to the mailbox and click the E button**": {
    "translation": "你只需要走到邮筒旁按下E键即可"
  },
  "**Santa Claus SideQuest completed!**": {
    "translation": "圣诞老人支线任务已完成!"
